    "description": "You are purchasing a \"VTG Lot Tobacco Estate Pipes Lee Tinder Box Kaywoodie Dr Grabow Savoy Dobbs +\" in \"Used\" condition.\nSet of six vintage wooden tobacco pipes stored in an Antonio y Cleopatra Grenadiers cigar box. This is a great mixed lot for collectors, display, prop use, or restoration projects. You’ll receive a variety of bowl shapes and stem styles, including a carved decorative pipe and both straight and slightly curved designs. Each pipe has lots of character, with the kind of patina and wear that only comes from years of use. The cigar box adds a classic touch and makes a convenient storage or display case. If you enjoy restoring old pipes, decorating a bar or man cave, or need authentic-looking props, this set offers plenty of vintage charm and visual interest. Includes: - 6 assorted wooden tobacco pipes (various shapes and styles) - 1 Antonio y Cleopatra Grenadiers 30 cigar box for storage/display Keywords: vintage tobacco pipes, wooden smoking pipe lot, pipe collection, rustic decor, man cave decor, bar display, cigar box, Antonio y Cleopatra box, prop pipes, restoration pipes\nSet of six wooden tobacco pipes with visible wear throughout. Finishes show scuffs, scratches, and discoloration, with some rims darkened from use. Stems display surface wear, light nicks, and some color fading. One pipe features carved decorative detailing with minor wear along the carving edges. Interior bowls are darkened with residue from prior smoking. Included Antonio y Cleopatra Grenadiers cigar box shows creasing, corner wear, and torn outer paper on the lid and edges. All used, sold as is.\nCondition Notes:\nSet of six wooden tobacco pipes with visible wear throughout. Finishes show scuffs, scratches, and discoloration, with some rims darkened from use. Stems display surface wear, light nicks, and some color fading. One pipe features carved decorative detailing with minor wear along the carving edges. Interior bowls are darkened with residue fro